Retry-After parsing:

```python
from email.utils import parsedate_to_datetime

def parse_retry_after(value: str) -> tuple[int | None, str | None]:
    if not value:
        return None, None
    v = value.strip()
    if v.isdigit():
        return int(v), None
    try:
        dt = parsedate_to_datetime(v)
        delta = int((dt - datetime.now(timezone.utc)).total_seconds())
        return max(delta, 0), None
    except Exception:
        return None, v
```

